#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:172
msgid ""
"The index is refreshed manually (`make rag-ingest`), not on a schedule — "
"it can lag the docs until regenerated."
msgstr "索引是手工刷新的（`make rag-ingest`），没有定时任务——在重新生成之前，它可能落后于文档。"

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:174
msgid ""
"The `HashEmbedder` fallback exists only so the pipeline runs without the "
"gateway (dev/CI); its retrieval quality is weak."
msgstr "`HashEmbedder` 这个回退方案只是为了让流水线在没有网关时也能跑（开发/CI）；检索质量很差。"

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:176
